{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No ammo, not much special weapon, you are on your own to survive the horror!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to escape from the doctors and creatures if you don't want a passive, painful radioactive gas death. Everything is corrupted here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your one and only friend is small bottles of holy water and your courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;The Lord is near to all who call on him, to all who call on him in truth&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787860/extras/story.gif?t=1749322428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Cult Trials: Incarnation you are Amelia, who woke up from deep-death sleep and found herself in a dark corrupted world. Deep mystery awaits you as you slowly dive deep and follow the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is going to be a trilogy of 3 chapters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot; We stood and watched as God abandoned us, and then we did the best we could &quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787860/extras/feature.gif?t=1749322428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore environments and Intense Psychological Horror</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787860/extras/env.gif?t=1749322428\" /><br><strong>Overcome Puzzles, Actions, and Secrets to Uncover</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787860/extras/action.gif?t=1749322428\" /><br><strong>Encounter horrific creatures, and experiments and use your wi